'''Hajime Saito''' (斎藤一, ''Saitō Hajime'') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy from the [[Rurouni Kenshin Collaboration Event]]. He was added in [[Version 13.4 Update|Version 13.4]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Hajime Saito
|image = E 691.png
|first appearance = [[Rurouni Kenshin Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 1,500¢ - 5,925¢
}}

==Enemy==
This enemy uses knockbacks to his advantage, similarly to how [[Mr. Puffington]] and [[Crocodylidae Kurocroc]] work. Attacks slowly, but attacks instantly again after being knocked back.

==Strategy==
The best ways to counter Hajime Saito are to either use [[:Category:Backliner-class Cats|backliners]] to attack him from a safe distance, or heavy hitters like [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] and [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]] to skip over some of his many knockbacks.

